{"markup": "<div data-component=\"page\" data-slug=\"origins\" data-name=\"page.origins\" data-v-f08e35e9><div data-component=\"origins\" _type=\"page.origins\" name=\"page.origins\" data-v-8deec1ef><div data-component=\"transition-logo-mask\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-24a16d5c><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" data-v-24a16d5c><defs data-v-24a16d5c><clipPath id=\"v-0-0-0\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" data-v-24a16d5c><path d=\"M0.5 0.459184C0.483235 0.501531 0.483824 0.506633 0.476471 0.540816H0.523529C0.516471 0.505612 0.514706 0.496429 0.5 0.459184Z\" data-v-24a16d5c></path></clipPath></defs></svg><div class=\"slot-wrapper\"  data-v-24a16d5c><header data-component=\"header\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-65fed905><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-65fed905><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-65fed905 data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-65fed905><div data-component=\"rive-asset\" class=\"canvas contain icon\" style=\"--ratio:300 / 620;\" data-v-65fed905 data-v-a98c4a7a><canvas data-file=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/945c2e6f9518fda188720fc8fd4216d363e009ec.riv\" width=\"300\" height=\"620\" data-v-a98c4a7a></canvas></div><h1 class=\"-display-title-2 -uppercase title\" data-v-65fed905>Origins</h1></div></header><main data-v-8deec1ef><section data-component=\"sub-header\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-0429417c><div data-component=\"chapter-text\" style=\"--columns:2;\" data-v-0429417c data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"g-col xxl-12 xl-14  lg-16 md-18 sm-8 xs-12  content-container\" data-v-5e4e5f48><h3 class=\"-mix-text-1-regular title floating-title\" data-v-5e4e5f48>(Origin)</h3><div class=\"content\" data-v-5e4e5f48><p>The secret lies in the origin. Tropical climates, rich soils, and ideal altitudes shape the subtle character of each bean. From Brazil to Ethiopia, from Colombia to Vietnam, each terroir leaves the unmistakable mark of its own identity. Depending on their origin, the Arabica and Robusta varieties express unique characteristics. The result?</p><p>A diverse range of compositions that include floral, fruity, chocolatey, or spicy notes. To understand the origins of coffee is to know it to be a living product. To tune into nature and to the refinement that time brings.<br>Delta’s passion is also its commitment: to select only the finest lots, supporting producers who share our vision of quality and sustainability.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section data-component=\"globe\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-19467169><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-19467169><div class=\"g-col xxl-16 sm-12\" data-v-19467169><h2 class=\"-mix-title-4 -text-center title\" data-v-19467169>The soil, the climate, the altitude.\nJust as the terroir defines a wine, origin defines the profile of a coffee.\n</h2></div></div><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-19467169><div class=\"g-col xxl-22 sm-12 xs-14 anim-container\" data-v-19467169><div data-component=\"rive-asset\" class=\"canvas contain animation\" style=\"--ratio:974 / 1032;\" data-v-19467169 data-v-a98c4a7a><canvas data-file=\"/assets/burospaces1.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026-08-04T15-26-00.538Z-Ciclo-do-Cafe-Origens.riv\" width=\"974\" height=\"1032\" data-v-a98c4a7a></canvas></div><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-left floating-subtitle\" data-v-19467169 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881></p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Guatemala</p></span></div></div><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-left floating-subtitle\" data-v-19467169 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881></p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Brazil</p></span></div></div><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-right floating-subtitle\" data-v-19467169 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881></p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Uganda</p></span></div></div></div></div></section><section data-component=\"types\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-6829c5f7><div class=\"g-row\" data-v-6829c5f7><div class=\"g-col xxl-9 xxl-offset-1 sm-7 xs-9\" data-v-6829c5f7><h2 class=\"-mix-title-3 title\" data-v-6829c5f7>The two major coffee families</h2></div><div class=\"g-col xxl-16 xxl-offset-2 sm-12 sm-offset-1\" data-v-6829c5f7><ul class=\"list\" data-v-6829c5f7><li class=\"item\" data-v-6829c5f7><div data-component=\"type\" _key=\"d5bb5cd801ed\" _type=\"item\" data-v-6829c5f7 data-v-4cfc58a2><div class=\"image-container\" data-v-4cfc58a2><img width=\"790\" height=\"1152\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Arabica Coffee Plant\" fetchpriority data-v-4cfc58a2 src=\"/assets/images/f02268b15c9a1f32ea602dec106d42b012f9b1f8-790x1152-34ddda4ace.png\"></div><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-4cfc58a2><div class=\"content-header\" data-v-4cfc58a2><h3 class=\"-mix-title-4 item-title\" data-v-4cfc58a2>Arabica </h3><p class=\"-sans-text-1-medium item-description\" data-v-4cfc58a2>Delicate and complex</p></div><ul class=\"list\" data-v-4cfc58a2><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Scents</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Floral, fruity</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Acidity</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Lively, elegant</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Body</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Light to medium</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Notes</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Jasmine, red fruits, smooth chocolate</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Altitude</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>800–2000m</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-6829c5f7><div data-component=\"type\" _key=\"11dec3dbf147\" _type=\"item\" data-v-6829c5f7 data-v-4cfc58a2><div class=\"image-container\" data-v-4cfc58a2><img width=\"790\" height=\"1104\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Robusta coffee plant\" fetchpriority data-v-4cfc58a2 src=\"/assets/images/0687dec78683770c423730361de04b7d15f3f7f4-790x1104-bf04de3a15.png\"></div><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-4cfc58a2><div class=\"content-header\" data-v-4cfc58a2><h3 class=\"-mix-title-4 item-title\" data-v-4cfc58a2>Robusta</h3><p class=\"-sans-text-1-medium item-description\" data-v-4cfc58a2>Intense and full-bodied</p></div><ul class=\"list\" data-v-4cfc58a2><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Aromas</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Intense, earthy</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Acidity</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Low</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Body</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Intense, dense</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Notes</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Bitter cocoa, wood, dried fruits</span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-4cfc58a2><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>Altitude</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium content\" data-text-enter data-v-4cfc58a2>0–800 m</span></li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section data-component=\"notes\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-55b11dd4><div class=\"chart-wrapper\" data-v-55b11dd4><div class=\"g-row align-center title-row\" data-v-55b11dd4><div class=\"g-col xxl-11 sm-8 xs-12 title-col\" data-v-55b11dd4><h2 class=\"-sans-text-2-medium title\" data-v-55b11dd4>Notes that tell stories</h2><p class=\"-mix-title-4 subtitle\" data-v-55b11dd4>Each origin leads us to a world of aromas</p></div></div><div data-component=\"pie-chart\" class=\"pie-chart\" data-v-55b11dd4 data-v-7a3c5c56><canvas class=\"chart\" data-v-7a3c5c56></canvas><div class=\"elements-layer\" data-v-7a3c5c56><ul class=\"list mobile-captions\" data-v-7a3c5c56><li class=\"item\" data-v-7a3c5c56><span class=\"-sans-headline-2\" data-v-7a3c5c56>Spices</span><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium\" data-v-7a3c5c56></span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-7a3c5c56><span class=\"-sans-headline-2\" data-v-7a3c5c56>Toasts</span><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium\" data-v-7a3c5c56></span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-7a3c5c56><span class=\"-sans-headline-2\" data-v-7a3c5c56>Fruity</span><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium\" data-v-7a3c5c56></span></li><li class=\"item\" data-v-7a3c5c56><span class=\"-sans-headline-2\" data-v-7a3c5c56>Citrus fruits</span><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium\" data-v-7a3c5c56></span></li></ul><div data-component=\"popup-area\" class=\"popup-area\" data-v-7a3c5c56 data-v-c716c6d6><div class=\"popups-container\" data-v-c716c6d6></div><div data-component=\"popup\" class=\"popup\" data-v-c716c6d6 data-v-68ea673b><div class=\"combined-bg\" data-v-68ea673b><div class=\"combined-color\" data-v-68ea673b></div></div><div class=\"inner\" data-v-68ea673b><div class=\"content\" style=\"--content-height: 200px; --content-width: 300px\" data-v-68ea673b><div class=\"item active\" data-v-68ea673b><span class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-68ea673b>Spices</span></div><div class=\"item\" data-v-68ea673b><span class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-68ea673b>Toasts</span></div><div class=\"item\" data-v-68ea673b><span class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-68ea673b>Fruity</span></div><div class=\"item\" data-v-68ea673b><span class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-68ea673b>Citrus fruits</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tail-spacer\" data-v-68ea673b></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"g-row align-center content-row\" data-v-55b11dd4><div class=\"g-col xxl-12 sm-8 xs-12 content-col\" data-v-55b11dd4><p class=\"-sans-headline-5 title\" data-v-55b11dd4>Coffee reveals itself in subtle notes: fruity, floral, sweet, toasted, with hints of spices. Each one tells a story. Together, they lead us into new worlds.</p></div></div></section><section data-component=\"selections\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"title-wrapper\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-9b8c06d9><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-9b8c06d9 data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"g-row content-container\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"g-col xxl-16 sm-14 xs-12 title-container\" data-v-9b8c06d9><h2 class=\"-sans-text-2-medium title\" data-v-9b8c06d9>Selection with Delta signature</h2><p class=\"-mix-title-2 subtitle\" data-v-9b8c06d9>Selecting coffee starts with choosing respect.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"g-row align-center list-wrapper\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"g-col xxl-32 sm-14 inner\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"top\" data-v-9b8c06d9><h3 class=\"-mix-title-5 list-title\" data-v-9b8c06d9>Coffee comes to life on the plantation and develops character with those who know how to respect it.</h3><div data-component=\"chapter-text\" style=\"--columns:1;\" class=\"description\" data-v-9b8c06d9 data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"content\" data-v-5e4e5f48><p>Each bean carries the landscape, the season, the assurance of the hand that picked it at just the right moment. However, the true essence of coffee only comes to light when someone knows how to listen to it.<br>At Delta, selection takes time, knowledge, and conviction. Because honouring coffee goes beyond knowing how to taste it — it involves recognising every step as essential, and only then signing it with pride.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"list\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div data-component=\"info-cards-list\" class=\"center\" data-v-9b8c06d9 data-v-cdc0a632><div class=\"cards-wrapper\" data-v-cdc0a632><div data-component=\"draggable-list\" class=\"\" data-v-cdc0a632 data-v-fc2fe470><ul class=\"list\" data-v-cdc0a632><li index=\"0\" class=\"item\" data-v-cdc0a632><div data-component=\"info-card\" class=\"vertical\" _key=\"1c9071a6d0c3\" _type=\"infoCard\" data-v-cdc0a632 data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"title-wrap\" data-v-070f4bf1><h3 class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular -text-center title\" data-v-070f4bf1>The right origin</h3></div><div class=\"vertical image-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><img width=\"520\" height=\"680\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-070f4bf1 src=\"/assets/images/464f5bc35999819f0c53b2d6f7f905a52a89d3ea-520x680-3015721d0c.jpg\"></div><div class=\"info-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"description\" data-v-070f4bf1><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium -text-center\" data-v-070f4bf1>We select only high-altitude coffees that are hand-picked and possess a distinct identity.</p></div></div></div></li><li index=\"1\" class=\"item\" data-v-cdc0a632><div data-component=\"info-card\" class=\"horizontal\" _key=\"f29db5b2adb2\" _type=\"infoCard\" data-v-cdc0a632 data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"title-wrap\" data-v-070f4bf1><h3 class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular -text-center title\" data-v-070f4bf1>Relationship with producers</h3></div><div class=\"horizontal image-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><img width=\"720\" height=\"498\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-070f4bf1 src=\"/assets/images/f9e6ba3fbd7e8d8139485932acc84d4c975680a7-720x498-5323579b20.jpg\"></div><div class=\"info-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"description\" data-v-070f4bf1><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium -text-center\" data-v-070f4bf1>We work with those who share our values. Close relationships, mutual trust, consistent harvests.</p></div></div></div></li><li index=\"2\" class=\"item\" data-v-cdc0a632><div data-component=\"info-card\" class=\"vertical\" _key=\"80340c8ba3bd\" _type=\"infoCard\" data-v-cdc0a632 data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"title-wrap\" data-v-070f4bf1><h3 class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular -text-center title\" data-v-070f4bf1>The exam as a ritual</h3></div><div class=\"vertical image-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><img width=\"520\" height=\"680\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-070f4bf1 src=\"/assets/images/bf1d66e4061c2fd95d2ef20451d2ab2adf3ad3db-520x680-432fbcc9a7.jpg\"></div><div class=\"info-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"description\" data-v-070f4bf1><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium -text-center\" data-v-070f4bf1>Before reaching the cup, our coffee undergoes technical tests, cupping sessions, and fine adjustments.</p></div></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"scrollbar-container\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"custom-scrollbar-wrapper\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"custom-scrollbar\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"scroll-thumb\" data-v-fc2fe470></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"g-row align-center content-wrapper\" data-v-9b8c06d9><div class=\"g-col xxl-24 sm-14\" data-v-9b8c06d9><h3 class=\"-mix-title-4 -text-center content\" data-v-9b8c06d9>The coffee is harvested far away, but it earns its signature here.\nWith the same passion each day for over 60 years.</h3></div></div></section></main><footer data-component=\"footer\" data-v-8deec1ef data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-ec4acc53 data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"scroll-helper-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium label\" data-v-ec4acc53>Keep scrolling for the next chapter</span><span class=\"scroll-helper\" data-v-ec4acc53><span class=\"progress\" data-v-ec4acc53></span></span></div><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"g-col xxl-28 sm-14 center\" data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"title-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><h2 class=\"-display-title-2 -uppercase title\" data-v-ec4acc53>Roast</h2></div><div class=\"icon-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><div data-component=\"rive-asset\" class=\"canvas contain icon\" style=\"--ratio:300 / 620;\" data-v-ec4acc53 data-v-a98c4a7a><canvas data-file=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/a835badee51e5121d9a9e1dbe8cb82e9c2bb63dc.riv\" width=\"300\" height=\"620\" data-v-a98c4a7a></canvas></div></div><div class=\"description-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><p class=\"-mix-text-1-regular description\" data-v-ec4acc53>Discover the art of Delta roasting: science and sensitivity bring out the unique sensory profiles of each coffee, ranging from light to dark roast.\n</p></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div></div>", "bodyClass": "page.origins", "title": "The secret lies \nin the origin | Delta Cafés — The coffee of your life", "stylesheet": "/styles/pages/coffee-cycle__origins.css"}